https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/P2M/Sol/S_AlgebraicCurve_Place_isSeparable_adjoin_of_ord_eq_one.lean

